    "sections": {
        "description": "Courier Shipping is a clean and structured theme designed for logistics providers, delivery services, and parcel handling businesses that need a clear and professional online presence. It features an intuitive layout with well-organized sections for service details, delivery information, pricing, and contact options, making it easy for visitors to navigate and find relevant information quickly. The design focuses on clarity and usability, helping businesses present their operations in a straightforward and reliable way. Built with performance in mind, the theme uses a lightweight structure that supports fast loading and smooth browsing across devices. It includes flexible customization options for layouts, colors, and content sections, allowing businesses to adapt the design to their brand without complexity. Courier Shipping works well with essential tools such as contact forms, booking features, and multilingual support, helping businesses reach a wider audience. Suitable for startups, local delivery services, and growing logistics companies, it provides a practical foundation for building a functional and user-friendly website."
    },
